      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to clarify that i'm having this issue as well, but completely unrelated to material swaps.\nAll my avatars that use non-humanoid transforms (specifically in a puppet menu affecting a tail) broke, even ones that were uploaded and confirmed functioning before. Debug menu shows the parameters are being affected and the states transitioning correctly. Putting the puppet menu on the FX layer solves the issue as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5fcc87ab39ba3a390a36b133",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f2f18d614baad5646416505",
        "alias": "Blush Coral",
        "aliasID": "65c7570fed6eefce4ccb8fcf",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/6b76617f2a5e2221bf36f85c95fc9383.png",
        "created": "2020-08-08T21:27:50.366Z",
        "name": "BananasaurusRex",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "bananasaurusrex"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "5d09629c3511d825c8e56214",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2020-12-06T07:26:35.702Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
