      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Happens on all SDK builds that are currently compatible with the new avatar 3.0 system as of late, and also the only fix I have found to cause the least amount of trouble and the quickest to apply was to ignore WD (WriteDefaults) Off workflow and keep it *ON* for all states in my FX layer. Apparently unmasked animations in FX that have WD off seem to be causing the issues.",
