      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58d60ee5acff4444923bdef0|full_name}: Ah, I didn't realise that the 2022.08.12.22.39 update meant that we could now set the \"top\" level mask in FX, I thought it was only referring to the masks on the other layers, since their behaviour changed such that those masks could now allow FX to take control of humanoid muscles away from Gesture.\nI can confirm that setting the \"top\" level mask works and also lets us work around the Unity bug. Just need to get Lyuma's avatar emulator updated so that it's not emulating the old behaviour now.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
