  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-14T20:54:20.292Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Due to how masking is currently setup, working material swaps will stop the gesture layer from being able to animate extra bones within armature that aren't part of the humanoid definition.\nIf you instead add layer masks to FX layer to allow the gesture layer to work properly, you won't be able to do material swap animations.\nThis is present on the current SDK and build 1010, it is also present on the current beta.\n\nI have not been able to find any work around, other than putting the bone animations on the FX layer, which goes against the documentation.",
